  "definition": "Millenarianism is the belief that Christ will personally reign on earth in a future era when evil is held in check and Christianity becomes universally dominant. It grows out of messianic hopes for a coming golden age of both worldly and spiritual prosperity, with the expected time and duration left indefinite.",
